# AUTO-GENERATED by scripts/generators/gen_demog_towns.py — do not edit manually
# The Demographics tab's Largest Cities (te_demog_sec_places, gui/te_demographics_widgets.gui): the ten slots
# the country census fills (te_demog_town_country, te_demog_place_effects.txt), largest first. Each slot is a
# one-state list, so an empty slot draws nothing; its row is one of six, by the town's kind (te_dg_tw<i>_c: 1
# the capital, 2 the port, 3 the mining, 4 the farming, 5 the logging town, 0 the state's own name), read
# through the state's owner, the country shown. The first three always; the rest under Show All
# (te_demog_towns_all_open).
